@page "/privacy-policy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy - CDL POOL</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4">
                <div class="card-body p-4 p-md-5">
                    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-1">Privacy Policy</h2>
                    <p class="text-muted mb-4">Effective Date: September 16, 2026</p>

                    <p>
                        CDL POOL GROUP INC ("CDL POOL," "we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect information provided through our website, advertisements, lead forms, and communications.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3 fw-bold">Information We Collect</h4>
                    <p>
                        We may collect information you voluntarily provide, including your name, phone number, email address, CDL experience, driving experience, trailer experience, employment preferences, and other information you provide when requesting information about available driving opportunities.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3 fw-bold">How We Use Your Information</h4>
                    <p>
                        We may use your information to review your qualifications, match you with available driving opportunities, communicate with you about those opportunities, respond to your inquiries, and provide recruiting-related services.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3 fw-bold">Phone and SMS Communications</h4>
                    <p>
                        By providing your phone number and opting in to receive communications, you agree that CDL POOL GROUP INC may contact you regarding driving and employment opportunities by telephone or text message. Message frequency may vary. Message and data rates may apply. Consent to receive marketing text messages is not a condition of obtaining services. You may opt out of text messages at any time by replying STOP. For assistance, reply HELP or contact us using the information below.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3 fw-bold">Sharing of Information</h4>
                    <p>
                        We may share relevant applicant information with transportation companies or business partners when necessary to evaluate or pursue an employment or independent-contractor opportunity. We do not sell your personal information for unrelated third-party marketing purposes.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3 fw-bold">Data Security</h4>
                    <p>
                        We use reasonable administrative and technical measures to protect the personal information provided to us. However, no electronic transmission or storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3 fw-bold">Your Choices</h4>
                    <p>
                        You may contact us to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information you have provided, subject to applicable legal and recordkeeping requirements. You may also ask us to stop contacting you.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3 fw-bold">Third-Party Platforms</h4>
                    <p>
                        Information submitted through third-party platforms, including Meta/Facebook or Instagram lead forms, may also be subject to the privacy policies and terms of those platforms.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3 fw-bold">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h4>
                    <p>
                        We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Any updates will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-3 fw-bold">Contact Us</h4>
                    <address class="mb-0">
                        <strong>CDL POOL GROUP INC</strong><br>
                        Email: <a href="mailto:contact@cdlpool.com">contact@cdlpool.com</a><br>
                        Phone: <a href="tel:+13313376351">331-337-6351</a><br>
                        Website: <a href="https://cdlpool.com">cdlpool.com</a>
                    </address>
                </div>
